    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you help me with a section on de-escalating patients who are acting in a very \"erratic\" or \"mischievous\" way? Like, they aren't necessarily screaming, but they're being disruptive, playing pranks, or just acting in a way that's hard to pin down and feels a bit chaotic.",
